    "signal, those of the rupture and the dynamic stress time to the time",
    "itself; the state of aging and slip law is compared by its logarithm. On",
    "fault2d, the amplitude is the one up to the time to which the exact",
    "solution holds at the receiver; on fault2d-periodic, the exact solution",
    "is the one of the spectral method of antiplane.py at the receiver (see",
    "run_case.compare_antiplane)."
